To move left and right, use the <b><color=\#000000>A</color></b> and <b><color=\#000000>D</color></b> keys. To jump, use the <b><color=\#000000>W</color></b> Key, hold for bigger jumps.
On your way you’ll see some coins. Pick them up to earn money, you’ll be able to start using them soon.
Once you start getting closer to your bounty Huxley, his mercenaries are going to start attacking you. 
To defeat them, use the mouse to aim and click to shoot your gun. Oh! And to reload the gun, use the <b><color=\#000000>Spacebar</color></b>. 
Watch out! If you get hit by an enemy you lose health!
Got it. #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
